s=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Jardinería · Vacaville y Dixon</p>\n    <h1>Vizcay Landscaping</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Transformamos jardines delanteros y traseros: césped artificial, adoquines, riego, plantas y diseños resistentes a la sequía, de la mano de Nick y su equipo.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>5.0 · 58 reseñas en Yelp<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Llama para cotizar</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Vizcay%20Landscaping%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095696\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Mapa</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">5.0★ de 58 reseñas</a></li><li>Césped artificial y pasto</li><li>Adoquines y obra exterior</li><li>Riego</li><li>Diseño de jardines</li><li>Obra limpia todos los días</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">El equipo</p><h2>Jardines que los vecinos se detienen a ver.</h2><p>Vizcay Landscaping es un contratista de jardinería con sede en Vacaville que atiende Vacaville, Dixon y los alrededores del condado de Solano. Nick Vizcay y su equipo se encargan de proyectos completos de jardín delantero y trasero, desde la demolición y el retiro de concreto hasta adoquines, riego, césped, plantas y corteza.</p><p>Tenemos 5 estrellas en 58 reseñas. Nuestros clientes destacan nuestra buena comunicación, la puntualidad del equipo, las ideas de diseño y que dejamos los jardines limpios y sin escombros al final de cada día.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>5.0★</b><span>58 reseñas</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>57 de 58</b><span>Reseñas de cinco estrellas</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>Lun–Vie</b><span>7 AM–7 PM</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/drought-tolerant.jpg\" alt=\"Jardín delantero con plantas resistentes a la sequía\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Servicios</p><h2>Lo que hacemos</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Diseño de jardines</h3></div><p>Te ayudamos a afinar tus ideas, con sugerencias de diseño que quizá no habías considerado.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Césped artificial</h3></div><p>Césped para jardines delanteros, traseros y áreas para perros.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación de pasto</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación de adoquines</h3></div><p>Patios y caminos de adoquín.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación de riego</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Instalación de plantas y corteza</h3></div><p>Incluidos jardines resistentes a la sequía.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Renovación completa de jardines</h3></div><p>Demolición y retiro de concreto, pasto y plantas viejas, y luego la nueva obra.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Iluminación de jardines</h3></div></article></div><p class=\"note\">Cada jardín es diferente, así que no tenemos una lista de precios publicada. Llama al (707) 590-0660 para una cotización.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Bueno saber</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Atendemos Vacaville y Dixon</b><span>Condado de Solano</span></li><li><b>Ideas de diseño</b><span>Te ayudamos a afinar tus ideas</span></li><li><b>Obra limpia</b><span>Dejamos el jardín sin escombros cada día</span></li><li><b>Atención de emergencias</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Jardines recientes</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/curb-turf.jpg\" alt=\"Césped en jardín delantero junto a la entrada de autos\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/front-yard-lighting.jpg\" alt=\"Jardín delantero iluminado al atardecer\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/backyard-turf.jpg\" alt=\"Césped artificial en el patio trasero\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/xeriscape-bed.jpg\" alt=\"Arriate con corteza y piedra\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lawn-edge.jpg\" alt=\"Borde curvo de pasto junto a un camino\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/front-lawn.jpg\" alt=\"Instalación de pasto en jardín delantero\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/drought-tolerant.jpg\" alt=\"Plantas resistentes a la sequía\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/turf-front-yard.jpg\" alt=\"Jardín delantero terminado con césped\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 58 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“If I could give Nick 100 Five-star ratings I would! He is kind, helpful, creative, hard-working and always shows up in an emergency ( like a missing broken valve that the previous owner buried in a mystery location in our yard!) He installed our landscaping in both our front and back yards. They are so stunning that neighbors walking their dogs stop to tell us they purposely walk down our street so they can see our yard. (BTW if Nick suggests adding lighting... don&#39;t hesitate!)”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/dixon/vizcay-landscaping-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jul 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Nick and his crew recently redid our entire backyard landscaping, from the demolition and removal of existing concrete, lawn, and plants, through the installation of pavers, plants, bark,...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kali J. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jun 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“My yard is beautiful. It&#39;s just what I wanted. Viscay Landscaping can be characterized by excellence, trust, and timeliness. Very responsive to ideas and requests. Nick Viscay and his crew and subcontractors were all very professional, polite, and effective. I highly recommend him.”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/dixon/vizcay-landscaping-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Oct 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Vizcay Landscaping did an amazing job at transforming our weed ridden front yard (knee high weeds after the rain) into a beautiful drought resistant landscape. The &quot;before&quot; picture is actually...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Susan S. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Apr 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Nick and his team did an amazing job! Great communication back and forth with quality service. They went the extra mile on our turf job and left the yard clean and debris free each day. I highly...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nick R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jan 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I recently had the pleasure of working with Vizcay Landscaping for a major landscaping project, and I cannot recommend them highly enough! From the moment I reached out, their team was incredibly fast and responsive, setting the tone for a truly exceptional experience. Everyday they arrived on time, fully equipped, and ready to tackle the job. Their team communicated with me every step of the way, ensuring I was informed and comfortable with the progress. It&#39;s clear that they value their customers! One of the standout aspects of this company was the valuable input they provided. They helped me refine my initial ideas, suggesting designs that I had not considered...”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/dixon/vizcay-landscaping-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I will say that working with Nick was probably one of my best experiences with a &quot;contractor&quot; and owner. He and his crew was always on time, professional and very reliable. Nick was also quick and...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Giemar F. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Recently we just completed a full front and backyard renovation with Vizcay Landscaping. It was an absolute pleasure to work with Nick and his whole team throughout the process. We called at...”</blockquote><figcaption>— Cassi M. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Feb 2022</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Qué zonas atienden?</summary><p>Atendemos Vacaville y Dixon, en el condado de Solano.</p></details><details><summary>¿Qué tipo de proyectos hacen?</summary><p>Diseño de jardines, césped artificial, instalación de pasto, adoquines, riego, plantas y corteza, hasta renovaciones completas de jardín delantero y trasero que empiezan retirando concreto, pasto y plantas viejas.</p></details><details><summary>¿Hacen jardines resistentes a la sequía?</summary><p>¡Sí! Hemos transformado jardines delanteros en paisajes resistentes a la sequía.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cómo pido una cotización?</summary><p>Llámanos al (707) 590-0660, de lunes a viernes de 7 AM a 7 PM.</p></details><details><summary>¿Con quién voy a trabajar?</summary><p>Trabajarás directamente conmigo, Nick Vizcay, y con mi equipo, con buena comunicación de principio a fin.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Zona de servicio</p>\n      <h2>Horario y zona de servicio</h2>\n      <address>Damos servicio en Vacaville, Dixon &amp; Solano County<br>Con sede en Vacaville, CA 95696</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\">(707) 590-0660</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miércoles</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Jueves</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Viernes</td><td>7 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sábado</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Domingo</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Llama para una cotización. Trabajamos a domicilio, no tenemos local.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/vizcay-landscaping-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17075900660\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-